====Usage notes====
There are two variations on the stressed syllable in the genitive case. Generally, they are interchangeable. However, when used in the expressions {{m|ru|ни хуя́}} and {{m|ru|до хуя́}}, the last syllable should be stressed.

In the expressions {{m|ru|на́ хуй}} and {{m|ru|по́ хую}}, the prepositions should be stressed.

